  "html": "<p>This is the outpost for <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>.  There is a portal to the Gulag itself and a portal back to level 5 of <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's </span></h2>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Scared_Lass\" title=\"Scared Lass\">Scared Lass</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Excited_Ladd\" title=\"Excited Ladd\">Excited Ladd</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Yakov_Smearnov\" title=\"Yakov Smearnov\">Yakov Smearnov</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Khodebshchik\" title=\"Khodebshchik\">Khodebshchik</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Ticked_Tomb_Curator\" title=\"Ticked Tomb Curator\">Ticked Tomb Curator</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
